{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-07", "window": 1, "start_date": 1530403200, "end_date": 1531094399, "month_true_total": 269, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:18:23 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "43412201", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995725038", "personaname": "Zoidmania", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/zoidmania/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 64, "playtime_forever": 30589, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1688, "last_played": 1786158292, "avatar": "ff2bfc42f27590a9dcf76813baeaad2919929c03"}, "language": "english", "review": "I hate this damn planet!", "timestamp_created": 1531094120, "timestamp_updated": 1589068748, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43410613", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973159013", "personaname": "Duckbert.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/duckbert/", "num_games_owned": 928, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 10097, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 600, "last_played": 1752777167, "avatar": "55d91c916a47c14cb86239d371a09e2355da658c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bought it in the Steam Sales for £11. Friends bought it too, good bit of fun this game.\n\nPros: \n*Lots of fun when you ramp up the challenge. \n*Intuitive, simple gameplay with different character classes that have different key perks. \n*Never the same cave twice (procedurally generated). \n*Minerals in games are shared - there's no kill-whoring in the Borderlands style of Co-op.\n*Cel-shaded graphics look gorgeous to me. Game can be played on low spec PC which makes it more accessible.\n*Drop in multiplayer gameplay makes joining a game midway very easy - if you have a group of friends, it makes sure no one gets left out.\n*Upgradeable equipment, perk trees and mission objectives in game.\n*Enemies are quite diverse and interesting to kill.\n*Game is still under construction. I've had this game for 7 days and they've already added updates twice.\n*No bloody microtransactions! Vanity Store uses in-game mined gold.\n\nCons:\n*Needs an overarching story or some overall mission structure to prolong interest. Still enjoying this now, but I think maybe a campaign or a way to upgrade your base over time would will keep players involved.", "timestamp_created": 1531087063, "timestamp_updated": 1531087063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43410486", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011678684", "personaname": "Nomadic Ghost", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198011678684/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 574, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 281, "last_played": 1604982753, "avatar": "e4663e578d1bef5e6e1eb5100e0f0dd05386f57f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Oddly Addictive. No two cave systems are alike, plus you get to kill giant space bugs. Who doesn't love killing giant space bugs.", "timestamp_created": 1531086532, "timestamp_updated": 1531086532, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43408942", "author": {"steamid": "76561198098601625", "personaname": "Texture", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198098601625/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 9588, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1549, "last_played": 1724442578, "avatar": "0251c63568171ea6064a7fbe3bc722fe51148a9f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really fun game to play with friends! The solo mode can be enjoyable, but it doesnt hold up as well as having a full team with all the abilities the diffrent classes bring.", "timestamp_created": 1531081422, "timestamp_updated": 1531081422, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "43404854", "author": {"steamid": "76561198003563235", "personaname": "se05239", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/se05239/", "num_games_owned": 384, "num_reviews": 128, "playtime_forever": 83158, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1490, "last_played": 1786022969, "avatar": "fa27644e99d4f043c5c6123b50f67893892b2f74"}, "language": "english", "review": "Surprisingly fun game that's best played in the company of friends.\n\nEDIT:\nI originally made this review when I had 24 hours and now, over 800 hours later, I am still playing the game several times a week. Although my multiplayer experience is limited, due to only playing Solo or with friends, I can say that the game is awesome nonetheless.", "timestamp_created": 1531068766, "timestamp_updated": 1652508828, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_